the extra stock and holding cost far more than the few sales it saves. Leftovers at the end are worth nothing, and candidate 4 also runs into the 220-unit warehouse limit.\n\n**Ordering less (candidate 7)**\n- At 0.9× it falls short by about 126 units of product 0 and 102 of product 1. The extra lost sales cost about 14–16 per unit, more than the purchase it saves.\n- It ends up about 600 behind candidate 1.\n\n**Cash limit**\n- Nothing arrives until day 5, so cash runs low on days 5–7. Candidate 1 is barely trimmed (a few units of product 1 on day 7).\n- Candidate 2 gets cut by about 10 units on day 5 and about 14 on day 7. Those cuts eat into its extra stock.\n\n**Batch ordering (candidates 3 and 6)**\n- Both save on the 27 daily fee: about 430 for candidate 3 and about 320 for candidate 6. They lose more than that on:\n  - holding a large stock between deliveries;\n  - cash cuts to the big orders on day 6;\n  - for candidate 3, deliveries spilling over the 220 limit (about 15–25 units of product 1 lost per delivery).\n\n**Ranking:** 1 > 2 > 7 ≈ 5 > 0 > 6 > 4 > 3."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 4969, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2269, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 4969}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-25T18:55:01.802Z", "request_id": "req_011CgPTctwaEZCrGfRGYzE68"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01RtNQ3nChwjKNi6926HtgPN", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_u